# Only service build inputs enter the root context.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!examples/
!examples/producers/
!examples/producers/outbox.rs
!examples/producers/*.sql
# Defense in depth for ignored/private files inside allowed directories.
**/.git
**/.env*
**/secrets
**/local
**/artifacts
**/exports
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
/UNBOUGHT_ANALYTICS_ENGINE.md
